ions? 2.07e6 * 1000 = 2.07e9 ops. GPU 1000 GOPS? Wait 1000 GOPS = 1e12 ops/s. Time = 2.07e9 / 1e12 = 0.00000207 s = 2 microseconds. So memory takes 66 us, compute 2 us, memory bottleneck. But 1000 GOPS plausible? Modern GPU maybe 10-30 TFLOPS. 1000 GOPS = 1 TFLOP, plausible for older. Or use 10 TFLOPS: compute time 0.2 us. Memory 66", "top2": [[[1596, -0.0007314376416616142], [760, -7.908448219299316]], [[1144, -2.014657366089523e-05], [1902, -11.461371421813965]], [[310, -0.694369375705719], [4087, -0.7513208985328674]], [[4087, -0.7449459433555603], [5707, -0.7745880484580994]], [[1156, -0.02045348472893238], [303, -3.9219980239868164]], [[25, -0.43251463770866394], [579, -1.1764987707138062]], [[328, -0.619322657585144], [10033, -1.1374157667160034]], [[814, -6.640177889494225e-05], [2523, -10.195714950561523]], [[20139, -5.722062269342132e-06], [10083, -12.566594123840332]], [[310, -0.00011873950279550627], [2423, -9.185173034667969]], [[264, -0.00013507324911188334], [21520, -9.184638977050781]], [[21520, -0.00032442109659314156], [2754, -9.319894790649414]], [[1496, -1.180178969661938e-05], [4962, -12.932401657104492]], [[33541, -0.00015891861403360963], [2812, -9.63216495513916]], [[5286, -3.099489549640566e-05], [26578, -10.95485782623291]], [[11, -4.1962550312746316e-05], [1076, -10.268820762634277]], [[303, -0.00016726461763028055], [883, -8.83261775970459]], [[883, -9.059946933120955e-06], [303, -13.415796279907227]], [[220, -3.4690503525780514e-05], [19, -11.150707244873047]], [[19, -3.182938598911278e-05], [18, -10.497838020324707]], [[15, -3.993590871687047e-05], [19, -10.173391342163086]], [[15, -3.576279254957626e-07], [16, -15.564704895019531]], [[4105, -3.337865791763761e-06], [3299, -13.27254867553711]], [[11, -0.000123150777653791], [1076, -9.92509651184082]], [[3069, -8.416530181420967e-05], [2423, -10.218425750732422]], [[264, -1.6808651707833633e-05], [13775, -11.24832534790039]], [[13775, -0.0005323515506461263], [30646, -8.110528945922852]],